&lt;p data-pm-slice=&quot;1 1 []&quot;&gt;FEQ228R125&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Senior Specialist Solutions Architect (Sr. SSA) for AI/ML, you will be the go-to technical expert for Databricks&#39; AI platform across our customers. You will help them move from AI experiments to &lt;strong&gt;governed, cost-efficient agents and ML systems running on the Databricks Data Intelligence Platform&lt;/strong&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will work with Account Executives and Solutions Architects to win strategic opportunities. You will design architectures for advanced agent and ML use cases and lead hands-on proofs of concept and MVPs. You will act as a trusted advisor to customer technical leaders on AI strategy, governance and economics. You will also shape our AI go-to-market in the region, enable the wider field team, and feed what you learn from customers back to Product and Engineering.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role reports to the Manager, Specialist Solutions Architects – Switzerland, Austria &amp;amp; Eastern Europe.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The impact you will have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Win the technical decision for AI on Databricks.&lt;/strong&gt; Lead discovery, architecture design, demos, proofs of concept and MVPs for agent, GenAI and ML use cases in competitive evaluations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Design production-grade agent systems.&lt;/strong&gt; Architect agents and multi-agent applications using Agent Bricks, Databricks Apps, MCP tools, Lakebase, AI Search and the Foundation Model APIs. Govern assets under Unity Catalog&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Make agent quality measurable.&lt;/strong&gt; Help customers build evaluation and observability into everything they ship, using MLflow tracing, domain-specific LLM judges, labelled evaluation datasets, release gates and production monitoring.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Govern AI at enterprise scale.&lt;/strong&gt; Position the AI Gateway as the central control point for model access, guardrails, PII protection, usage tracking and rate limiting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Scale your expertise.&lt;/strong&gt; Enable SAs and partners with workshops, reusable assets and reference architectures.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Influence the product.&lt;/strong&gt; Bring structured customer feedback and requirements specific to the market to Product Management and Engineering.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Be a visible voice.&lt;/strong&gt; Represent Databricks at customer executive briefings, meetups, conferences and in written content.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we look for&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;7+ years of hands-on experience in machine learning, AI engineering or data science, including customer-facing technical work (pre-sales, consulting or technical leadership).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A track record of shipping LLM and agent systems to production&lt;/strong&gt;, not just prototypes, including evaluation, monitoring and cost management.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deep knowledge of agent architecture: tool use and function calling, MCP, agent memory and state, orchestrating multiple agents, and retrieval and context design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong practical experience &lt;strong&gt;evaluating GenAI systems&lt;/strong&gt;: tracing, LLM-as-a-judge, building evaluation datasets, regression testing and observability in production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on with at least one modern agent framework (e.g. LangGraph, OpenAI Agents SDK, Google ADK, DSPy). You should be framework-agnostic in how you design.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of the foundation-model landscape (e.g. Anthropic, OpenAI, Google, open-weight models) and the trade-offs between quality, latency, cost and data residency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong grounding in classical ML and MLOps: model development, deployment, monitoring and lifecycle management at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong software engineering skills in Python and SQL. You use AI coding assistants (e.g. Claude Code, Cursor) daily and can build a working demo application quickly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with at least one major cloud platform (AWS, Azure or GCP) and modern data platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to influence technical leaders up to CTO/CDO level and to explain complex AI topics in business terms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven ability to communicate and teach complex technical concepts to both technical and non-technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Databricks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family: arial, sans-serif;&quot;&gt;Databricks is the Data and AI company. More than 20,000 organizations worldwide — including adidas, AT&amp;amp;T, Bayer, Block, Mastercard, Rivian, Unilever, and 70% of the Fortune 500 — rely on the Databricks Data + AI Platform to build and scale data and AI apps, analytics and agents. Headquartered in San Francisco with 30+ offices around the globe, Databricks offers a unified platform that includes Genie, Lakebase, Agent Bricks, Lakeflow, Lakehouse, and Unity Catalog. To learn more, follow Databricks on &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/company/databricks&quot;&gt;LinkedIn&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://x.com/databricks&quot;&gt;X&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.youtube.com/@Databricks&quot;&gt;YouTube&lt;/a&gt;, and &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.instagram.com/databricksinc/?hl=en&quot;&gt;Instagram&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;At Databricks, we strive to provide comprehensive benefits and perks that meet the needs of all of our employees. For specific details on the benefits offered in your region click &lt;a href=&quot;https://docs.google.com/document/d/154un3e8Xav4BceOSlcYFZRGEuQI54xMxVydRwQn54eQ/edit?usp=sharing&quot;&gt;here&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
